From: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(autoware_multi_object_tracker): include the boost::hash header

boost::hash is declared in boost/container_hash/hash.hpp. Boost.Uuid 1.86
stopped including it from uuid_hash.hpp, so "hash is not a member of
boost". boost/functional/hash.hpp forwards to it in every Boost release.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/autowarefoundation/autoware_universe/pull/13592]
Signed-off-by: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
---
 src/debugger/debug_object.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/debugger/debug_object.hpp b/src/debugger/debug_object.hpp
index 00779dd7d0..5c8baf6c42 100644
--- a/src/debugger/debug_object.hpp
+++ b/src/debugger/debug_object.hpp
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@
 #include <geometry_msgs/msg/point.hpp>
 #include <visualization_msgs/msg/marker_array.hpp>
 
+#include <boost/functional/hash.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid_hash.hpp>
 
